{"3517880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clawsome", "steam_appid": 3517880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/a4a21e08c1e716743e5b74e535eac989.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1015 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clawsome</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game where you play as a Claw machine trying to collect every toy in the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across four distinct zones inspired by Japan — <strong>Kamakura, Tokyo, Kyoto, and Shirakawa </strong>— and clear handcrafted claw-machine levels to collect unique prizes, unlock hidden stories, and restore a charming miniature world piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b43d2b194a16b4fcd921e9bcc194c79f.poster.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b43d2b194a16b4fcd921e9bcc194c79f.webm?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b43d2b194a16b4fcd921e9bcc194c79f.mp4?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/57ee51bdbe2e8fc0fa8f69ecf1b75ba2.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1015 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate as you please. </strong>Place the figures and objects you unlock, experiment with charming arrangements, and personalize each diorama piece by piece. Decoration is not just a reward — it is part of the heart of <strong>Clawsome</strong>, turning every successful grab into something you can keep, display, and make your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/cca0cbf4e5b76c62eee7cb5e05bc070c.poster.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/cca0cbf4e5b76c62eee7cb5e05bc070c.webm?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/cca0cbf4e5b76c62eee7cb5e05bc070c.mp4?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/1e727bbb811614b0cd0c929b430e3815.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1015 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put your problem-solving skills up to test.</strong> Each level is a handcrafted claw-machine board with its own objectives, surprises, and physical interactions. Catch the right prizes, experiment with the environment, and solve challenges to move forward through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions ask you to rescue or collect specific characters, while others hide their true solution behind level interactions, funny situations, or puzzles that are not visible at first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/a3c658190b1a554cc91c54f69accf583.poster.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/a3c658190b1a554cc91c54f69accf583.webm?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/a3c658190b1a554cc91c54f69accf583.mp4?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/06099db4579c59eb58ecc65c14d7f903.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1015 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completionist mode activated!</strong> Every object you collect helps bring your Toy Dioramas to life. These dioramas showcase your progress through beautifully crafted, story-driven scenes that reveal the delightful world of Clawsome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/0dbca196c4128420c01f02d256ad61a8.poster.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/0dbca196c4128420c01f02d256ad61a8.webm?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/0dbca196c4128420c01f02d256ad61a8.mp4?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy lighthearted challenges, charming collectibles, and a touch of mayhem, Clawsome is the perfect game for you with a mix of cozy vibes and unpredictable fun. Test your skills in the most delightful grabber game ever! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Each grab will bring you endless excitement!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/a4a21e08c1e716743e5b74e535eac989.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1015 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clawsome</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game where you play as a Claw machine trying to collect every toy in the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across four distinct zones inspired by Japan — <strong>Kamakura, Tokyo, Kyoto, and Shirakawa </strong>— and clear handcrafted claw-machine levels to collect unique prizes, unlock hidden stories, and restore a charming miniature world piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b43d2b194a16b4fcd921e9bcc194c79f.poster.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b43d2b194a16b4fcd921e9bcc194c79f.webm?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/b43d2b194a16b4fcd921e9bcc194c79f.mp4?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/57ee51bdbe2e8fc0fa8f69ecf1b75ba2.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1015 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate as you please. </strong>Place the figures and objects you unlock, experiment with charming arrangements, and personalize each diorama piece by piece. Decoration is not just a reward — it is part of the heart of <strong>Clawsome</strong>, turning every successful grab into something you can keep, display, and make your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/cca0cbf4e5b76c62eee7cb5e05bc070c.poster.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/cca0cbf4e5b76c62eee7cb5e05bc070c.webm?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/cca0cbf4e5b76c62eee7cb5e05bc070c.mp4?t=1787172917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/extras/1e727bbb811614b0cd0c929b430e3815.avif?t=1787172917\" width=1015 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put your problem-solving skills up to test.</strong> Each level is a handcrafted claw-machine board with its own objectives, surprises, and physical interactions. Catch the right prizes, experiment with the environment, and solve challenges to move forward through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions ask you to rescue or collect specific characters, while others hide their true solution behind level interactions, funny situations, or puzzles that are not visible at first glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap