nter\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy lighthearted challenges, charming collectibles, and a touch of mayhem, Clawsome is the perfect game for you with a mix of cozy vibes and unpredictable fun. Test your skills in the most delightful grabber game ever! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Each grab will bring you endless excitement!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Help Clawby find unique friends in this wholesome adventure! Collect cute figurines with the help of Clawby to create colorful dioramas in this cozy claw machine game.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/b0f57eb0f56ba363385485e7d2051d84018da6a7/header.jpg?t=1787172917", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/18d7533393010ecb1d92c27f88fe67382de6b486/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787172917", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517880/18d7533393010ecb1d92c27f88fe67382de6b486/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787172917", "website": "http://cometagames.mx", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Optimized for low-end devices.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:<